<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sp-body">
      <h2 class="sp-question">Do you want to create a weekend of new memories exploring the most unique Christmas market on the East Coast without having to spend the hours it takes trying to piece it together yourself?</h2>
      <p>Bethlehem Pennsylvania feels like a Hallmark Movie and a European Christmas Town had a baby. The Christkindlmarkt (the German Style Christmas Market) is incredible.</p>
      <p>And as someone who's actually been there (solo with a kid by the way) you need more than a day - it's 100% worth a full weekend.</p>
      <p>I already made those decisions on my trip. This guide is that weekend, written down.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
