        <li>A 31 page guide with decisions already made and just enough options to give you variety for all budgets without feeling like more homework</li>
        <li>A curated experience without spending the hours and hours of research it would require you to put together something good enough for you and still doable with kids</li>
        <li>Two easy to follow itineraries based on my actual experience, not generic information copy and pasted from the internet</li>
        <li>The exact 3 star hotel I stayed at that saved me $127 a night, plus my hotel recommendations for all budget types</li>
        <li>Links to reserve everything in advance so nothing is sold out by the time you show up</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
