      <details>
        <summary>What's the difference between this and using AI to plan the trip?</summary>
        <p>As someone who uses AI, it is only as good as the prompts you give it. So if you don't know exactly what questions to ask - it's easy to miss out on small details that make a big difference and experiences that could make or break your trip. And honestly, because it pulls information from the internet, it is not always accurate. This guide also gives you what AI cannot - an actual human experience from someone who's been there before, made the mistakes, and is putting an optimized weekend into one 31 page guide that you can keep coming back to.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is this guide just an itinerary or options?</summary>
        <p>This guide is both - all the research to plan your own epic weekend, behind the scenes details that can make or break your weekend PLUS two easy to follow itineraries done for you.</p>
      </details>
